#: usr/share/big-kernel-manager/ui/mesa_data.py:186
msgid ""
"VDPAU for AMD/NVIDIA open-source — legacy API being replaced by VAAPI and Vulkan. Probably not "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"VDPAU AMD/NVIDIA avatud lähtekoodiga jaoks – pärand API asendatakse VAAPI ja Vulkaniga. Ilmselt "
"pole vaja."
# 
